# Temporary Scripts

When creating one-off, exploratory, or debugging scripts, write them to `packages/data/scripts/temp/` instead of `packages/data/scripts/`. The `packages/data/scripts/temp/` directory is gitignored and will not be committed.

Only scripts that are meant to be long-lived and re-run regularly should live in `packages/data/scripts/` directly. Current permanent scripts:

- `sync-pokemon-catalog-collections.mjs` — Rebuilds collection tags on all catalog entries
- `build-pokemon-data-cache.mjs` — Fetches and caches enriched Pokemon data from PokeAPI
- `audit-collection-tags.mjs` — Audits collection tagging accuracy
- `species-collection-slug-sets.json` — Data file used by sync script
